[{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/3218922300","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/issues/109946#issuecomment-3218922300","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/109946","id":3218922300,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc6_3Ns8","user":{"login":"Cykyrios","id":53737317,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjUzNzM3MzE3","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/53737317?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Cykyrios","html_url":"https://github.com/Cykyrios","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Cykyrios/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Cykyrios/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Cykyrios/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Cykyrios/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Cykyrios/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Cykyrios/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Cykyrios/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Cykyrios/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Cykyrios/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2025-08-25T05:51:52Z","updated_at":"2025-08-25T05:54:40Z","body":"For reference, here are some comparison screenshots (Fcitx5 + mozc here as well, on Manjaro KDE Wayland):\n\n<img width=\"220\" height=\"170\" alt=\"X11\" src=\"https://github.com/user-attachments/assets/64f65e8a-23fc-44b5-9da4-25def64aae04\" />\n\nThe text appears in the IME popup, but will only appear in the editor or project after confirming it. The above occurs in X11 projects, and I assume in the X11 editor as well. In the Wayland editor and Wayland projects, text appears as expected (in Godot 4.5, at least):\n\n<img width=\"220\" height=\"150\" alt=\"Wayland\" src=\"https://github.com/user-attachments/assets/131c3bde-3648-4b19-93ba-d9672f41dc3a\" />\n\nOne thing to note in the Wayland editor, is that in both the scene tree and filesystem docks, the IME popup itself is positioned incorrectly at the top of the screen, instead of next to the text being typed; the script editor and other docks seem to work as expected in this regard.","author_association":"CONTRIBUTOR","pin":null,"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/3218922300/reactions","total_count":1,"+1":1,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/3225997272","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/issues/109946#issuecomment-3225997272","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/109946","id":3225997272,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc7ASM_Y","user":{"login":"fel-pt","id":79886727,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjc5ODg2NzI3","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/79886727?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/fel-pt","html_url":"https://github.com/fel-pt","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/fel-pt/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/fel-pt/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/fel-pt/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/fel-pt/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/fel-pt/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/fel-pt/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/fel-pt/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/fel-pt/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/fel-pt/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2025-08-26T23:01:40Z","updated_at":"2025-08-26T23:01:40Z","body":"I'm not sure if this issue is somehow related or if it should be reported on its own, but I'd rather err on the side of caution and talk about it first here.\n\nI've just tested using both mozc on the Steam Deck and the Microsoft IME on Windows 11 while running a test app, and found that there are also issues there. This happens both with native applications on Windows and Linux, as well as Web applications.\n\nFirst, if the application is run on exclusive fullscreen, the IME popup will not appear. I'm not sure if this is even avoidable due to the nature of exclusive fullscreen.\n\nHowever, in other modes, the popup will show up, but it will only appear in the right place if the window has not been scaled in any way. This includes launching a lower resolution game in (non-exclusive) full screen or scaling a windowed game.\n\nRunning at the set resoution:\n![Image](https://github.com/user-attachments/assets/56061b8d-5404-41fb-8ac6-155f543cae08)\n\nAfter scaling the window:\n![Image](https://github.com/user-attachments/assets/26a69931-14b2-4bf0-848d-dd63bc1e10a4)\n\nAt some resolutions it can even cover the textbox.\n![Image](https://github.com/user-attachments/assets/85159f0a-4730-49cf-be5b-a39faef8c681)","author_association":"NONE","pin":null,"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/3225997272/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/3226737837","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/issues/109946#issuecomment-3226737837","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/109946","id":3226737837,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc7AVByt","user":{"login":"bruvzg","id":7645683,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjc2NDU2ODM=","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/7645683?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/bruvzg","html_url":"https://github.com/bruvzg","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bruvzg/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bruvzg/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bruvzg/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bruvzg/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bruvzg/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bruvzg/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bruvzg/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bruvzg/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bruvzg/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2025-08-27T04:58:44Z","updated_at":"2025-08-27T04:58:44Z","body":"> First, if the application is run on exclusive fullscreen, the IME popup will not appear. I'm not sure if this is even avoidable due to the nature of exclusive fullscreen.\n\nUnavoidable, that's one of the reasons non-exclusive mode was added.\n\n> However, in other modes, the popup will show up, but it will only appear in the right place if the window has not been scaled in any way. This includes launching a lower resolution game in (non-exclusive) full screen or scaling a windowed game.\n\nPosition should be fixable, but not the popup scale.","author_association":"MEMBER","pin":null,"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/3226737837/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/3226933903","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/issues/109946#issuecomment-3226933903","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/109946","id":3226933903,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc7AVxqP","user":{"login":"bruvzg","id":7645683,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjc2NDU2ODM=","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/7645683?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/bruvzg","html_ur