":"https://github.com/bruvzg","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bruvzg/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bruvzg/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bruvzg/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bruvzg/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bruvzg/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bruvzg/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bruvzg/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bruvzg/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bruvzg/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2025-08-27T07:09:09Z","updated_at":"2025-08-27T07:09:09Z","body":"I can't reproduce any popup position issues on Windows either.","author_association":"MEMBER","pin":null,"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/3227035978/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/3227489124","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/issues/109946#issuecomment-3227489124","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/109946","id":3227489124,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc7AX5Nk","user":{"login":"fel-pt","id":79886727,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjc5ODg2NzI3","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/79886727?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/fel-pt","html_url":"https://github.com/fel-pt","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/fel-pt/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/fel-pt/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/fel-pt/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/fel-pt/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/fel-pt/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/fel-pt/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/fel-pt/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/fel-pt/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/fel-pt/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2025-08-27T09:36:20Z","updated_at":"2025-08-27T09:36:20Z","body":"> I can't reproduce any popup position issues on Windows either.\n\nI probably won't have the time to run more tests to give some more information today, but I can add some more details.\n\n- The test program was a just a Node2D with a LineEdit child. It was set to run at 640*360. If the resolution wasn't changed, the Microsoft IME popup would show up in the right place. I ran it both throught the Editor, through an exported executable and as a web application on Chrome. The behavior was the same on all of them.\n\n- If the resolution was in any way stretched, the window would show up at a different position. One thing I did notice after reporting, is that the popup would also show up at a different position just by adding a Camera2D as a child of the Node2D.\n\n- In the meantime, I found a similar issue that had already been reported: https://github.com/godotengine/godot/issues/107411\nIn my case I'm using the viewport stretch mode and keeping the aspect ratio, though.","author_association":"NONE","pin":null,"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/3227489124/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/3227501731","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/issues/109946#issuecomment-3227501731","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/109946","id":3227501731,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc7AX8Sj